OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain in the south at first,
OL,6,Fquickly clearing. Then generally dry
OL,7,Fwith good spells of sunshine and a
OL,8,Frisk of showers. Very strong westerly
OL,9,Fwinds developing in the morning, with
OL,10,Fgales a risk over high ground.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear skies,
OL,13,Fthough there may be some showers at
OL,14,Ftimes. The strong winds will start to
OL,15,Fease through the evening, though
OL,16,Fstrong gusts will still be possible.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FGenerally fine and dry with
OL,19,Fsunny spells, though the odd shower
OL,20,Fcan't be ruled out. Winds easing
OL,21,Ffurther to become light by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
