OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,6,Fwarm Sunday, with rain at times. Drier
OL,7,FMonday, with a band of potentially
OL,8,Fheavy rain and strong winds moving in
OL,9,Fduring the evening. Rain and strong
OL,10,Fwinds for Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
